            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "花旗：半導體股回調是買入良機",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"花旗：半導體股回調是買入良機\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1d4612510838aaed3bbee21704197319e69f674ed99d4ef11d552a73e21441f1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA7B05U_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">花旗：半導體股回調是買入良機</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 花旗銀行週二在一份投資者報告中指出，半導體股近期的回調是難得的買入機會，並認為市場對AI支出放緩的擔憂已明顯過度。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">花旗指出，英偉達與博通（Broadcom）的管理層均對上述擔憂予以反駁，強調底層基礎設施需求依然強勁，與花旗的積極看法一致。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">博通首席執行官陳福陽（Hock Tan）重申，對公司2027財年AI半導體營收達到1,150億美元目標充滿信心。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">花旗表示，AI領域的戰略主導地位至關重要，尤其是在中美科技競爭日趨激烈的背景下，這使得「AI投資出現大幅縮減的可能性極低」。花旗還指出，美國總統唐納德·特朗普（Donald Trump）也持相同立場，強調美國必須在科技領域保持對中國的領先優勢。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-b1334d36-2381-35e0-9926-0cd3bb26ad83-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">儘管持續的政策辯論與安全討論或許會令前沿模型的發展步伐有所放緩，但花旗認為，AI推理需求的持續增長，加上供應端的持續緊張，將支撐整個產業生態系統的資本投入進一步擴大。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">花旗甚至認為，部署節奏放緩未必是壞事。花旗在報告中寫道：「AI基礎設施需求若能更為循序漸進地釋放，最終或許對相關股票更為有利。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">花旗對英偉達與博通均給予「買入」評級，英偉達目標價為315美元，博通目標價為515美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%8A%B1%E6%97%97-%E5%8D%8A%E5%B0%8E%E9%AB%94%E8%82%A1%E5%9B%9E%E8%AA%BF%E6%98%AF%E8%B2%B7%E5%85%A5%E8%89%AF%E6%A9%9F-120011843.html",
