        {
            "title": "短炒波士｜港股暫看淡 恒指處分水嶺之下｜Ringo",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1b9c953513841a1aa2db1cb01af539d2cf24dc38d8ebfbc2f464ba354915e4b3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fbossmind_356%2F09f7f5d52f89946d0674e1fa483fa64f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">港股周二下挫超過200點，創兩個月低位。恒指分水嶺為25,000點，現處分水嶺之下，故暫時仍以看淡為主。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國AI巨頭呼籲放慢AI發展，內地大語言模型商也受到拖累，智譜（2513）及MINIMAX（100）捱沽。環球AI發展有機會放慢，加上智譜及MINIMAX均屬未有盈利企業，在加息環境下若要繼續借貸發展，其利息成本將會加重，估值亦會被拉低，故從基本面來看，現時不宜「撈底」。至於已持貨的投資者，則可等待出現技術性反彈時止蝕離場。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-5e782fea-fc5c-3127-b53b-76f33aaa6353-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">小米（1810）正處築底階段，但現價屬「高不升低不就」的情況，投資者等待進一步回待至25元或以下，逐步吸納作中長線部署。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國本月加息機會急增，金價受壓。美元短期料處強勢，金價年內的波幅框架仍維持在每盎司4,000至4,800美元。短線金價料在4,200美元見支持，跌至此水平才買入短炒也不遲。中長線而言，多個支持金價的因素未有大變，可逢低吸納作中長線持有。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國費城半導體指數周一大跌超過半成。美國費城半導體指數龍頭股的盈利能力仍強，投資者可考慮趁低吸納追蹤費城半導體指數ETF。不過，投資者不應貿然買入具槓桿成分的費城半導體指數ETF，因費城半導體指數料會處橫行局面，短期未見出現單邊走勢。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Ringo</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">資深投資者</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">註：專欄作家言論不代表本網立場</p><a class=\"mb-module-gap\" data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"img\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:img;elmt:link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://signup.hkiei.com/ringo_webinar_bossmind\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"686\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ef0392fff138ce203525e9dd0f076e746ec426df9baca315c099c01ed5c5e142/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fbossmind_356%2Ff52012128630469615370091d56ff897.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></a></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%9F%AD%E7%82%92%E6%B3%A2%E5%A3%AB-%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1%E6%9A%AB%E7%9C%8B%E6%B7%A1-%E6%81%92%E6%8C%87%E8%99%95%E5%88%86%E6%B0%B4%E5%B6%BA%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%8B-ringo-114500163.html",
